{"schema_version":"1.0","case_id":"py-order-pricing-project","input":{"prompt":"完成三个文件组成的小型订单计算程序。money.discounted_cents(price_cents, discount_bps) 返回打折后的整数分金额，采用四舍五入、半分向上；price_cents 为非负整数，discount_bps 为0～10000的整数，表示减免比例，两者均不接受布尔值。order.total_cents(items, discount_bps=0) 对每行先计算打折单价，再乘数量并求和，返回整数。items 必须为列表，每行必须是恰含 price_cents、quantity 的字典，两字段均为非负整数且不接受布尔值；discount_bps 遵循同一规则，空列表也须验证折扣。非法输入统一抛 ValueError，不修改输入。main.py 接收唯一一个UTF-8订单JSON文件路径，文件顶层必须是恰含 items、discount_bps 的对象，任意层级的重复键及NaN/Infinity均非法。成功stdout只输出一个仅含整数 total_cents 的JSON对象，允许JSON外侧空白，stderr为空，退出0；参数、文件读取、UTF-8解码、JSON或业务输入错误时stdout为空、stderr为 invalid order 加换行、退出2。导入三个模块时stdout/stderr均为空且不执行CLI。仅使用标准库，允许临时自检脚本；最终代码仅依赖交付的三个文件与标准库。 最终运行不依赖临时自检脚本或未公开的工作目录文件；评分使用新输入和目录。","files":{"money.py":"def discounted_cents(price_cents, discount_bps):\n    return price_cents * (10000 - discount_bps) // 10000\n","order.py":"from money import discounted_cents\n\n\ndef total_cents(items, discount_bps=0):\n    raise NotImplementedError\n","main.py":"from order import total_cents\n\n\ndef main():\n    raise NotImplementedError\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    raise SystemExit(main())\n"}},"expectations":{"artifacts":["money.py","order.py","main.py"],"checks":[{"id":"round1","points":5,"conditions":[{"id":"of1","kind":"call","module":"money","function":"discounted_cents","args":[1,5000],"returns":1}]},{"id":"round2","points":5,"conditions":[{"id":"of2","kind":"call","module":"money","function":"discounted_cents","args":[3,5000],"returns":2}]},{"id":"round3","points":5,"conditions":[{"id":"of3","kind":"call","module":"money","function":"discounted_cents","args":[199,2500],"returns":149}]},{"id":"total1","points":10,"conditions":[{"id":"of4","kind":"call","module":"order","function":"total_cents","args":[[{"price_cents":1,"quantity":2}],5000],"returns":2}]},{"id":"total2","points":10,"conditions":[{"id":"of5","kind":"call","module":"order","function":"total_cents","args":[[{"price_cents":10,"quantity":3}],0],"returns":30}]},